/* FAQ — Usage */
"faq.usage.goalstatuscolors.q" = "What do the goal status colors mean?";
"faq.usage.goalstatuscolors.a" = "The color next to your goal status is a quick progress signal based on your latest value. Green means you’re on track, yellow means you’re still close but it’s worth watching, and red means the latest result is more clearly away from the goal. It’s meant to help you scan progress quickly, not judge your health.";
